WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.886 --> 00:00:02.263
SCOTT LANG
I don't care who this guy is.

00:00:02.313 --> 00:00:04.811
I don't care what he can do.
This is our fight.

00:00:05.965 --> 00:00:06.650
HOPE VAN DYNE
You ready?

00:00:06.701 --> 00:00:07.363
SCOTT LANG
Ready.

00:00:08.242 --> 00:00:11.013
KANG THE CONQUEROR
I will burn them out of time

00:00:11.855 --> 00:00:12.856
for what they've done to me.

00:00:12.906 --> 00:00:13.579
[Screaming]

00:00:15.691 --> 00:00:17.072
SCOTT LANG
You're not getting out.

00:00:20.197 --> 00:00:20.828
CASSIE LANG
Dad!

